Nuvio Desktop

This project is a desktop port/fork effort for Nuvio and is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3, or later.

Release artifacts must include:

- LICENSE
- NOTICE
- dependency license inventory (docs/dependency-licenses.md)
- source availability instructions (docs/source-availability.md)
- native dependency provenance (docs/native-dependency-provenance.md)

Written offer for source code (GPL):

  The complete corresponding source for every released binary is the tagged commit it
  was built from, at https://github.com/g1mliii/nuviodesktop-port (release tag
  v<VERSION>), and is also shipped as a reproducible source tarball
  (nuvio-desktop-src-<VERSION>.tar.gz). If you cannot obtain it there, request it from
  info@anchored.site with the version; we will provide the corresponding source. Full
  terms: docs/source-availability.md.

mpv/libmpv is NOT bundled — it is discovered/launched at runtime. See
docs/native-dependency-provenance.md.

Third-party dependency notices are tracked in docs/dependency-licenses.md (generated by
scripts/generate-license-inventory.*) and must remain complete before public binary
distribution.
